)","detail":"デモムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:74088","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"723カン","creatorId":"vndb:s10571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10571","name":"723カン","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:32614","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"RUNA","creatorId":"vndb:s3057","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3057","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3057","name":"SATOMI","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:32616","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c67821","characterName":"エレノア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59025","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229716"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18154"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67821"},"originalCharacterName":"エレノア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最高神・オーディンの娘にして、ヴァルキリーたちのリーダー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"底知れない包容力とハッとする美貌、文武に秀でた能力、優しい気質で、誰からも信頼される至高の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、若いころは戦いを嫌い、人間世界でひっそり暮らそうとしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな時、人間の英雄・シグルドと出会い、激しい恋に落ち、「誰かを助けるためには、力を持たねばならない」と気づかされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"掟に従い、シグルドと別れヴァルキリーとなった彼女だが、その優しい心は変わらず、理想と現実のギャップに密かに葛藤している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18154","sourceWorkId":"10866","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最高神オーディンの娘。ヴァルキリーのリーダー。誰からも信頼され、ほかの戦乙女たちからは神的扱いを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とくに、イリスにとっては究極の理想像である。底知れない包容力と、並ぶ者のない美貌をあわせもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にかつての恋人・シグルドを人質にとられて、監禁・陵辱されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59025"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee2c6636a7a03c21c6a8d6eff4a0cd7bfa566d4fc3aee2c5632c525c713addae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03f06b5ae73b0563ef7cc7cfb7f300bfda0a3b2210661bf8552e61143824c246.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"和葉","creatorId":"vndb:s1623","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1623","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1623","name":"伊藤 葉純","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17344","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67822","characterName":"イリス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59026","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229716"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18155"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67822"},"originalCharacterName":"イリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"武神・テュールの娘で、「最強のヴァルキリー」と呼ばれる戦乙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレノアに憧れ、シグルドに師事し、鍛練を怠らない武人気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく爽やかで、誰からも好かれる魅力的な女性だが、戦い以外のことは不慣れで、特に恋愛やエッチに対しては、強い苦手意識を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18155","sourceWorkId":"10866","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"武神テュールの娘。数々の武勇伝を誇る、名高いヴァルキリー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレノアに憧れ、日々鍛錬を重ねた結果、「最強のヴァルキリー」と呼ばれるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"尊敬するエレノアとシグルドを人質にとられて、監禁・陵辱されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59026"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76c1ad2c256b0e79a410f83625052c205ee8bac8f1d3b8c940567e0aebf1f740.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb2ce0c4ca0149df56d08db500a5713a3ef3c0fe6beecbbb3915dd80375de50a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あえか","creatorId":"vndb:s9085","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9085","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9085","name":"あえか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17345","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67823","characterName":"ユーニス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59027","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229716"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18156"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67823"},"originalCharacterName":"ユーニス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋に落ちたエレノアとシグルドの間に生まれた娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァルキリーとしては新入りだが、その潜在能力は母親以上と言われ、未熟で小生意気なところもあるが、気高く凛とした佇まいも持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平和に育つことを望んだ母の意志に反し、自らヴァルキリーに志願、命令に忠実に従う姿から、冷たい心を持つと思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし内心では、誰より愛情に飢えていて、まだ会ったことのない父・シグルドに強い憧れを抱き、心の支えにしている様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18156","sourceWorkId":"10866","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレノアの娘で、新入りのヴァルキリー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"潜在的な神的能力が強く、本気を出せば、イリス以上とも噂されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小生意気なところもあるが、気高く凛としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母・エレノアと父・シグルドを人質にとられて、監禁・陵辱されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59027"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26b5d82cfa8e040038e4b2d23667a33ecad723868bc9d556608411738b9649dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c6a6583a21bfe981e228842b34664c20f35e8c0f0f64e1743681e27bca221cc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲 ゆたか","creatorId":"vndb:s1595","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1595","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1595","name":"坂田 有希","roleCode":"voice-act